OL,3,GNEWSAFormer ministers lose out in Isle
OL,4,Aof Man general election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree former ministers have lost their
OL,7,Fseats in the 2026 Isle of Man general
OL,8,Felection.
OL,10,FFormer health minister Lawrie Hooper,
OL,11,Fformer infrastructure minister Michelle
OL,12,FHaywood and former education minister
OL,13,FJulie Edge have all lost their seats.
OL,15,FTwo new members have been elected in
OL,16,FRamsey, with former commissioners Juan
OL,17,FMcGuinness and Robert Cowell both being
OL,18,Felected.
OL,20,FIn Middle, Deputy Chief Minister Jane
OL,21,FPoole-Wilson topped the poll followed
OL,22,Fby James Cochrane.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
